OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FWindy and
OL,6,Fcloudy. Rain will soon extend from the
OL,7,Fwest across the whole area during the
OL,8,Fevening, perhaps turning heavy at
OL,9,Ftimes over western hills.
OL,10,
OL,11,CSunday:FCloud, rain, afternoon hill
OL,12,Fsnow, passing erratically late
OL,13,Fafternoon and through the evening as
OL,14,Fisolated showers and clear spells
OL,15,Ffollow from the northwest.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FA
OL,18,Fband of rain and hill snow reaching
OL,19,Ffrom the south Tuesday. Otherwise
OL,20,Ffrosty starts, then dry with sunny
OL,21,Fspells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
